{"ref":"BDB, טֻמְאָה","hw":"טֻמְאָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">טֻמְאָה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. uncleanness</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">ט׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 5:19\" href=\"/Numbers.5.19\">Nu 5:19</a> + 4 times; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">טֻמְאַת</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 5:3\" href=\"/Leviticus.5.3\">Lv 5:3</a> + 4 times; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">טֻמְאָתֵךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 22:15\" href=\"/Ezekiel.22.15\">Ez 22:15</a> + 2 times etc., + 18 times sfs.; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">טֻמְאֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 16:16\" href=\"/Leviticus.16.16\">Lv 16:16</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 16:19\" href=\"/Leviticus.16.19\">19</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">טֻמְאוֹתֵיכֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 36:25\" href=\"/Ezekiel.36.25\">Ez 36:25</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 36:29\" href=\"/Ezekiel.36.29\">29</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">טֻמְאֹתָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 16:16\" href=\"/Leviticus.16.16\">Lv 16:16</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  sexual <a data-ref=\"Numbers 5:19\" href=\"/Numbers.5.19\">Nu 5:19</a> (P), <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 1:9\" href=\"/Lamentations.1.9\">La 1:9</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  of a foul or filthy mass <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 24:11\" href=\"/Ezekiel.24.11\">Ez 24:11</a> (in a caldron), <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 29:16\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.29.16\">2 Ch 29:16</a> (in the temple).<br><strong>3.</strong>  ethical and religious <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 16:16\" href=\"/Leviticus.16.16\">Lv 16:16</a> (P), <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 22:15\" href=\"/Ezekiel.22.15\">Ez 22:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 24:13\" href=\"/Ezekiel.24.13\">24:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 39:24\" href=\"/Ezekiel.39.24\">39:24</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">כפר על הקדשׁ מט׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 16:16\" href=\"/Leviticus.16.16\">Lv 16:16</a> (P); <span dir=\"rtl\">קדּשׁ מט׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 16:19\" href=\"/Leviticus.16.19\">Lv 16:19</a> (P); <span dir=\"rtl\">טהר מט׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 24:13\" href=\"/Ezekiel.24.13\">Ez 24:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 36:25\" href=\"/Ezekiel.36.25\">36:25</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">הושׁיע מכל ט׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 36:29\" href=\"/Ezekiel.36.29\">36:29</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">רוּחַ הט׳</span> <em>unclean spirit</em>, which inspired the prophets to lie <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 13:2\" href=\"/Zechariah.13.2\">Zc 13:2</a>.<br><strong>4.</strong>  ritual, of men <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 5:3\" href=\"/Leviticus.5.3\">Lv 5:3</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 7:20\" href=\"/Leviticus.7.20\">7:20</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 7:21\" href=\"/Leviticus.7.21\">21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 14:19\" href=\"/Leviticus.14.19\">14:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 15:3\" href=\"/Leviticus.15.3\">15:3</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 15:31\" href=\"/Leviticus.15.31\">31</a><sup>(×2)</sup> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 19:13\" href=\"/Numbers.19.13\">Nu 19:13</a> (all P), <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 22:3\" href=\"/Leviticus.22.3\">Lv 22:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 22:5\" href=\"/Leviticus.22.5\">5</a> (H); of women <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 11:4\" href=\"/II_Samuel.11.4\">2 S 11:4</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיִּשְׁכַּב עִמָּהּ וְהִיא מִתְקַדֶּשֶׁת מִטֻּמְאָתָהּ</span> v. Dr; a time favourable to conception RS<sup>K 276</sup>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 15:25\" href=\"/Leviticus.15.25\">Lv 15:25</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 15:26\" href=\"/Leviticus.15.26\">26</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 15:30\" href=\"/Leviticus.15.30\">30</a> (P), <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 18:19\" href=\"/Leviticus.18.19\">18:19</a> (H), <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 36:17\" href=\"/Ezekiel.36.17\">Ez 36:17</a>; of meats <a data-ref=\"Judges 13:7\" href=\"/Judges.13.7\">Ju 13:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 13:14\" href=\"/Judges.13.14\">14</a>.<br><strong>5.</strong>  local, of the nations <a data-ref=\"Ezra 6:21\" href=\"/Ezra.6.21\">Ezr 6:21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 9:11\" href=\"/Ezra.9.11\">9:11</a>.","next":"BDB, טָמְאָה","prev":"BDB, טָמֵא²"}